### Admin Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

# Notes:
# - Replace {{ADMIN_EMAIL}} and {{ADMIN_PASSWORD}} with your admin credentials.
