### Get Current Admin Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Get Admin Permissions
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Get Admin Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create Admin (with permissions)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Admin",
  "email": "new.admin@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+12345678901",
  "password": "StrongPass1!",
  "pages": ["dashboard", "orders", "products"],
  "full": false,
  "active": true
}

### Update Admin (profile and/or permissions)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/{{adminId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Admin",
  "pages": ["dashboard", "orders", "users"],
  "full": true,
  "active": false,
  "password": "NewPass1!"
}

