### ========== FAQ MANAGEMENT ==========

### Get All FAQs (with pagination and filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs?page=1&limit=10&search=&category=&isPublished=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Get FAQ Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Get FAQ by ID
@faqId = your_faq_id_here
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs/{{faqId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create FAQ
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How do I reset my password?",
  "answer": "To reset your password, click on the 'Forgot Password' link on the login page. Enter your email address and follow the instructions sent to your email.",
  "category": "Account",
  "order": 1,
  "isPublished": true
}

### Update FAQ
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs/{{faqId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How do I reset my password? (Updated)",
  "answer": "To reset your password, click on the 'Forgot Password' link on the login page. Enter your registered email address and follow the instructions sent to your email.",
  "category": "Account Management",
  "order": 2,
  "isPublished": true
}

### Update FAQ (Partial - Only Published Status)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/faqs/{{faqId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

